<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>GOLDEN HEAVEN GROUP HOLDINGS LTD.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>EXTRAORDINARY GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>February 7, 2025</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>9:30 a.m., Eastern Time</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>PROXY STATEMENT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The board of directors (the &ldquo;<B>Board of
Directors</B>&rdquo;) of Golden Heaven Group Holdings Ltd. (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;) is soliciting proxies for the extraordinary
general meeting of shareholders (the &ldquo;<B>Meeting</B>&rdquo;) of the Company to be held on February 7, 2025, at 9:30 a.m., Eastern
Time. The Company will hold the Meeting at No. 8 Banhouhaichuan Rd, Xiqin Town, Yanping District, Nanping City, Fujian Province, China
353001, which shareholders will be able to attend in person and via live audio webcast online at www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/GDHG2025.
Shareholders will have an equal opportunity to participate at the Meeting and engage with the directors, management, and other shareholders
of the Company online, regardless of their geographic location.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Registered shareholders and duly appointed proxyholders
will be able to attend, participate and vote at the Meeting or any adjournment thereof in real time. Beneficial shareholders who hold
their shares through a broker, investment dealer, bank, trust corporation, custodian, nominee or other intermediary who have not duly
appointed themselves as proxyholder will be able to attend as guests and may view the webcast, but will not be able to participate in
or vote at the Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Only holders of the Class A ordinary shares and
Class B ordinary shares (collectively, the &ldquo;<B>ordinary shares</B>&rdquo;) of the Company of record at the close of business on
January 21, 2025 (the &ldquo;<B>Record Date</B>&rdquo;) are entitled to attend and vote at the Meeting or at any adjournment thereof.
The shareholders entitled to vote and present in person or by proxy or (in the case of a shareholder being a corporate entity) by its
duly authorised representative representing not less than one-third of the voting rights of the outstanding ordinary shares carrying the
right to vote at the Meeting shall form a quorum.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Any shareholder entitled to attend and vote at
the Meeting is entitled to appoint a proxy to attend and vote on such shareholder&rsquo;s behalf. A proxy need not be a shareholder of
the Company. Each holder of the Company&rsquo;s Class A ordinary shares shall be entitled to one vote in respect of each Class A ordinary
share held by such holder on the Record Date. Each holder of the Company&rsquo;s Class B ordinary shares shall be entitled to 200 votes
in respect of each Class B ordinary share held by such holder on the Record Date.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>PROPOSALS TO BE VOTED ON</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">At the Meeting, resolutions will be proposed as
follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Proposal
1: RESOLVED AS AN ORDINARY RESOLUTION, </FONT>the increase of the Company&rsquo;s authorised share capital, such that the authorised share
capital be increased from US$210,000 divided into: (i) 36,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000
Class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each, to US$10,030,000 divided into: (i) 2,000,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of par
value of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each (the &ldquo;<B>Share Capital Increase</B>&rdquo;)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Proposal 2: RESOLVED AS A SPECIAL RESOLUTION,
that the first sentence in Clause 8 of the currently effective Fourth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the
Company be deleted and replaced, and the Fifth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company as set forth
in Appendix A to the notice of the extraordinary general meeting of shareholders of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Fifth Amended M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;)
be adopted as the new memorandum and articles of association of the Company, in substitution for the Fourth Amended and Restated Memorandum
and Articles of Association of the Company then in effect, to reflect the Share Capital Increase.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 3; Value: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->3<!-- Field: /Sequence --></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Proposal 3: RESOLVED AS A SPECIAL RESOLUTION,
the reorganization of the Company&rsquo;s share capital, to be effected at such time and date (the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation Effective
Time</B>&rdquo;), if at all, to be determined by the Company&rsquo;s board of directors (the &ldquo;<B>Board of Directors</B>&rdquo;)
in its sole discretion within one calendar year after the conclusion of the Meeting, as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 48pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">(a)</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">after completion of the Share Capital Increase,
the Company&rsquo;s authorised share capital of </FONT>US$10,030,000 to be divided into: (i) 2,000,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of
par value of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">,
be consolidated at a share consolidation ratio of 5:1, such that </FONT>the authorised share capital of US$10,030,000 will be divided
into: (i) 400,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of par value of US$0.025 each, and (ii) 1,200,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of
US$0.025 each (the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation&rdquo;</B>)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">, where:</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 96pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 72pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">a.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">the then issued Class A ordinary shares and then issued Class B ordinary shares in the capital of the
Company, each with a par value of US$0.005 each, at the Share Consolidation Effective Time will be consolidated at a share consolidation
ratio of 5:1 so as to become such whole number of Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares with a par value of US$0.025 each
(after rounding, if necessary) as shall result therefrom (collectively, the &ldquo;<B>Consolidated Issued Shares&rdquo;</B>)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">;
and</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 96pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 72pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">b.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">that, following the consolidation, the proportion between the amount paid and the amount, if any, unpaid
on each consolidated share will be the same as it was immediately before the Share Capital Consolidation in the case of the shares from
which it was derived<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">;</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 48pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt">(c)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">at the Share Consolidation Effective Time, the first sentence in Clause 8 of the then effective Fifth
Amended M&amp;A be deleted and replaced, and the Sixth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company as set
forth in Appendix B to the notice of the extraordinary general meeting of shareholders of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Sixth Amended M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;)
be adopted as the new memorandum and articles of association of the Company, in substitution for the Fifth Amended M&amp;A, to reflect
the Share Consolidation; and</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 48pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt">(d)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">the Board of Directors be authorised to do all other such acts and things as the Board of Directors considers
necessary or desirable for the purposes of the transactions contemplated by the Share Capital Increase and the Share Consolidation, including
determining whether to proceed with the Share Consolidation, determining the Share Consolidation Effective Time, confirming the number
of the Consolidated Issued Shares, and instructing the registered office provider or transfer agent of the Company to complete the necessary
filing(s) to reflect the Share Capital Increase and the Share Consolidation (if at all).</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>The Board of Directors recommends a vote &ldquo;FOR&rdquo;
each of the Proposals No. 1 &ndash; 3.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>VOTING PROCEDURE FOR HOLDERS OF ORDINARY SHARES</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Shareholders entitled to vote at the Meeting may
do so either in person or by proxy. Those shareholders who are unable to attend the Meeting are requested to read, complete, sign, date,
and return the attached proxy card in accordance with the instructions set out therein.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>ANNUAL REPORT TO SHAREHOLDERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Pursuant to the Marketplace Rules of Nasdaq Stock
Market, which permit companies to make available their annual report to shareholders on or through the Company&rsquo;s website, the Company
posts its annual reports on the Company&rsquo;s website. The annual report for the fiscal year ended September 30, 2023 on Form 20-F (the
&ldquo;<B>2023 Annual Report</B>&rdquo;) has been filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission. The Company adopted this practice
to avoid the considerable expense associated with mailing physical copies of such report to record holders. You may obtain a copy of the
Company&rsquo;s 2023 Annual Report to shareholders by visiting the Company&rsquo;s website at ir.jsyoule.com. If you want to receive a
paper or email copy of the Company&rsquo;s 2023 Annual Report to shareholders, you must request one. There is no charge to you for requesting
a copy. Please make your request for a copy to the Investor Relations of the Company, available at ir.jsyoule.com.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>


<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 4; Value: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->4<!-- Field: /Sequence --></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>PROPOSAL NO. 1</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>SHARE CAPITAL INCREASE</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>General</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
Board of Directors believes that it is in the best interests of the Company and the shareholders, and is hereby soliciting shareholders&rsquo;
approval, to </FONT>increase of the Company&rsquo;s authorised share capital, such that the authorised share capital be increased from
US$210,000 divided into: (i) 36,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000 Class B ordinary shares
of par value of US$0.005 each, to US$10,030,000 divided into: (i) 2,000,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of par value of US$0.005 each,
and (ii) 6,000,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each (the &ldquo;<B>Share Capital Increase</B>&rdquo;)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Resolution to be Voted On</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The resolution to be proposed shall be as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">RESOLVED
AS AN ORDINARY RESOLUTION, </FONT>the increase of the Company&rsquo;s authorised share capital, such that the authorised share capital
be increased from US$210,000 divided into: (i) 36,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000 Class
B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each, to US$10,030,000 divided into: (i) 2,000,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of par value
of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each (the &ldquo;<B>Share Capital Increase</B>&rdquo;)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Vote Required for Approval</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Proposal No. 1 will be approved if at least a
simple majority of the total votes properly cast in person or by proxy at the Meeting by the holders of ordinary shares of the Company
entitled to vote at the Meeting vote &ldquo;FOR&rdquo; the proposal. Abstentions and broker non-votes will have no effect on the result
of the vote.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B>THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECOMMENDS<BR>
A VOTE <I>FOR<BR>
</I>SHARE CAPITAL INCREASE.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>


<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 5; Value: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->5<!-- Field: /Sequence --></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>PROPOSAL NO. 2</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>FIFTH AMENDED M&amp;A</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>General</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Board of Directors believes that it is in
the best interests of the Company and the shareholders, and is hereby soliciting shareholders&rsquo; approval, to reflect the Share Capital
Increase, to adopt the Fifth Amended and Restated memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company as set forth in Appendix A to
the notice of the extraordinary general meeting of shareholders of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Fifth Amended M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;), in substitution
for the Fourth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company then in effect.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Resolution to be Voted On</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The resolution to be proposed shall be as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">RESOLVED AS A SPECIAL RESOLUTION, that the first
sentence in Clause 8 of the currently effective Fourth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company be deleted
and replaced with the following:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;The authorised share
capital of the Company is US$10,030,000 divided into: (i) 2,000,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of par value of US$0.005 each, and (ii)
6,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares of par value of US$0.005 each&hellip;&rdquo;,</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">and the Fifth Amended and Restated Memorandum
and Articles of Association of the Company as set forth in Appendix A to the notice of the extraordinary general meeting of shareholders
of the Company be adopted as the new memorandum and articles of association of the Company, in substitution for the Fourth Amended and
Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company then in effect, to reflect the Share Capital Increase.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Vote Required for Approval</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Proposal No. 2 will be approved if at least two
thirds of the total votes properly cast in person or by proxy at the Meeting by the holders of ordinary shares of the Company entitled
to vote at the Meeting vote &ldquo;FOR&rdquo; the proposal. Abstentions and broker non-votes will have no effect on the result of the
vote.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECOMMENDS<BR>
A VOTE <I>FOR<BR>
</I>FIFTH AMENDED M&amp;A.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>


<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 6; Value: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->6<!-- Field: /Sequence --></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>PROPOSAL NO. 3</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>SHARE CONSOLIDATION</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>General</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Board of Directors believes that it is in
the best interests of the Company and the shareholders, and is hereby soliciting shareholders&rsquo; approval, to approve and authorize
the Board of Directors to effect an reorganization of the Company&rsquo;s share capital as follow:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 48pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">(a)</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">after completion of the Share Capital Increase,
the Company&rsquo;s authorized share capital of </FONT>US$10,030,000 to be divided into: (i) 2,000,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of
par value of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">,
be consolidated at a share consolidation ratio of 5:1, such that </FONT>the authorised share capital of US$10,030,000 will be divided
into: (i) 400,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of par value of US$0.025 each, and (ii) 1,200,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of
US$0.025 each (the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation</B>&rdquo;)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">, where:</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 96pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 72pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">a.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">the then issued Class A ordinary shares and then issued Class B ordinary shares in the capital of the
Company, each with a par value of US$0.005 each, at the Share Consolidation Effective Time will be consolidated at a share consolidation
ratio of 5:1 so as to become such whole number of Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares with a par value of US$0.025 each
(after rounding, if necessary) as shall result therefrom (collectively, the &ldquo;<B>Consolidated Issued Shares</B>&rdquo;)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">;
and</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 96pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 72pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">b.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">that, following the consolidation, the proportion between the amount paid and the amount, if any, unpaid
on each consolidated share will be the same as it was immediately before the Share Capital Consolidation in the case of the shares from
which it was derived<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">;</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Board of Directors may determine, in its sole
discretion, whether to implement the Share Capital Consolidation, as well as the specific time and date (the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation
Effective Time</B>&rdquo;), provided that any implementation is within one calendar year after the conclusion of the Meeting. The Board
of Directors reserves the right not to implement the Share Capital Reorganization, even if shareholders approve Proposal No. 3 at the
Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Share Consolidation will be implemented simultaneously
for all ordinary shares. The Share Consolidation will affect all shareholders uniformly and will have no effect on the proportionate holdings
of any individual shareholder, with the exception of adjustments related to the treatment of fractional shares (see below).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Sixth Amended and Restated Memorandum and
Articles of Association of the Company as set forth in Appendix B to the notice of the extraordinary general meeting of shareholders of
the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Sixth Amended M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;), which is proposed to substitute the Fifth Amended M&amp;A, will be adopted
to reflect the Share Consolidation.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Registration and Trading of our Class A ordinary
shares</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Share Consolidation will not affect the registration
of the Class A ordinary shares or the Company&rsquo;s obligation to publicly file financial statements and other information with the
U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission. If and when the Share Consolidation is implemented, the Class A ordinary shares will begin trading
on a post-split basis on the Share Consolidation Effective Time. In connection with the Share Consolidation, the CUSIP number of the Class
A ordinary shares (which is an identifier used by participants in the securities industry to identify our Class A ordinary shares) will
change.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 7; Value: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->7<!-- Field: /Sequence --></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Fractional Shares</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">No fractional shares shall be issued in connection
with the Share Consolidation and all fractional shares (after aggregating all fractional shares that would otherwise be received by a
shareholder) resulting from the Share Consolidation shall instead be rounded up to the whole number of shares.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Street Name Holders of Class A ordinary shares</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Company intends for the Share Consolidation
to treat shareholders holding Class A ordinary shares in street name through a nominee (such as a bank or broker) in the same manner as
shareholders whose shares are registered in their names. Should the Board of Directors choose to effect the Share Consolidation, nominees
will be instructed to effect the Share Consolidation for their beneficial holders. However, nominees may have different procedures. Accordingly,
shareholders holding Class A ordinary shares in street name should contact their nominees.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Share Certificates</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Should the Board of Directors choose to effect
the Share Consolidation, the Company&rsquo;s transfer agent will adjust the record books of the Company to reflect the Share Consolidation
as of the Share Consolidation Effective Time.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Resolution to be Voted On</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The resolution to be proposed shall be as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">RESOLVED AS A SPECIAL RESOLUTION, the reorganization
of the Company&rsquo;s share capital, to be effected at such time and date (the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation Effective Time</B>&rdquo;),
if at all, to be determined by the Company&rsquo;s board of directors (the &ldquo;<B>Board of Directors</B>&rdquo;) in its sole discretion
within one calendar year after the conclusion of the Meeting, as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 48pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">(a)</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">after completion of the Share Capital Increase,
the Company&rsquo;s authorized share capital of </FONT>US$10,030,000 to be divided into: (i) 2,000,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of
par value of US$0.005 each, and (ii) 6,000,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.005 each<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">,
be consolidated at a share consolidation ratio of 5:1, such that </FONT>the authorised share capital of US$10,030,000 will be divided
into: (i) 400,000,000 Class A ordinary shares of par value of US$0.025 each, and (ii) 1,200,000 Class B ordinary shares of par value of
US$0.025 each (the &ldquo;<B>Share Consolidation</B>&rdquo;)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">, where:</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 96pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 72pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">a.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">the then issued Class A ordinary shares and then issued Class B ordinary shares in the capital of the
Company, each with a par value of US$0.005 each, at the Share Consolidation Effective Time will be consolidated at a share consolidation
ratio of 5:1 so as to become such whole number of Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares with a par value of US$0.025 each
(after rounding, if necessary) as shall result therefrom (collectively, the &ldquo;<B>Consolidated Issued Shares</B>&rdquo;)<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">;
and</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 96pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 72pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">b.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">that, following the consolidation, the proportion between the amount paid and the amount, if any, unpaid
on each consolidated share will be the same as it was immediately before the Share Capital Consolidation in the case of the shares from
which it was derived<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">;</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 8; Value: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->8<!-- Field: /Sequence --></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left; text-indent: -24pt">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 48pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt">(c)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">at the Share Consolidation Effective Time, the first sentence in Clause 8 of the then effective Fifth
Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company (the &ldquo;Fifth Amended M&amp;A&rdquo;) be deleted and replaced
with the following:</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left">&ldquo;The authorised share capital of
the Company is US$10,030,000 divided into: (i) 400,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of par value of US$0.025 each, and (ii) 1,200,000 Class
B Ordinary Shares of par value of US$0.025 each&hellip;&rdquo;,</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: left">and the Sixth Amended and Restated Memorandum
and Articles of Association of the Company as set forth in Appendix B to the notice of the extraordinary general meeting of shareholders
of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Sixth Amended M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;) be adopted as the new memorandum and articles of association of the Company,
in substitution for the Fifth Amended M&amp;A, to reflect the Share Consolidation; and</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 48pt"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 24pt; text-align: left">(d)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">the Board be authorised to do all other such acts and things
as the Board considers necessary or desirable for the purposes of the transactions contemplated by the Share Capital Increase and the
Share Consolidation, including determining whether to proceed with the Share Consolidation, determining the Share Consolidation Effective
Time, confirming the number of the Consolidated Issued Shares, and instructing the registered office provider or transfer agent of the
Company to complete the necessary filing(s) to reflect the Share Capital Increase and the Share Consolidation (if at all).</TD>
</TR></TABLE>



<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Vote Required for Approval</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">Proposal No. 3 will be approved if at least two
thirds of the total votes properly cast in person or by proxy at the Meeting by the holders of ordinary shares of the Company entitled
to vote at the Meeting vote &ldquo;FOR&rdquo; the proposal. Abstentions and broker non-votes will have no effect on the result of the
vote.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Share Consolidation, if approved by our shareholders
and determined to be proceeded by the Board of Directors, will become effective upon the Share Consolidation Effective Time chosen by
the Board of Directors.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECOMMENDS<BR>
A VOTE <I>FOR<BR>
</I>THE SHARE CONSOLIDATION.</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>


<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 9; Value: 2 -->
    <DIV STYLE="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->9<!-- Field: /Sequence --></P></DIV>
    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt"></P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>OTHER MATTERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The Board of Directors is not aware of any other
matters to be submitted to the Meeting. If any other matters properly come before the Meeting, it is the intention of the persons named
in the enclosed form of proxy to vote the shares they represent as the Board of Directors may recommend.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

