  <tr style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left"><font style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Power to vary class rights</font></td>
