  <tr style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td colspan="2" style="text-align: left"><font style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Consequences of sale of Shares
    to satisfy lien</font></td>
    <td style="text-align: center"><font style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">10</font></td></tr>
